{"id":"ordinaire","lemma":"ordinaire","pos":"adj","rank":1973,"glosses":["ordinary","mediocre, nondescript"],"ipa":"/ɔʁ.di.nɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/Fr-ordinaire.ogg/Fr-ordinaire.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"ordinaires"},"examples":[{"text":"Ton comportement sort de l'ordinaire.","en":"Your behavior is out of the ordinary.","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"behaviour/behavior"},{"g":"fate, destiny"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous menons une vie très ordinaire.","en":"We lead a very ordinary life.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to lead, to take","l":"mener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Que faites-vous chez vous, d’ordinaire ?","en":"What do you usually do at home?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"D'ordinaire, je mange dehors.","en":"I usually eat outside.","words":[{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to eat","l":"manger"},{"g":"outside"}]},{"text":"Rien ne semblait sortir de l'ordinaire.","en":"Nothing seemed out of the ordinary.","words":[{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to seem","l":"sembler"},{"g":"to exit"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}